onarchy, while the Residence is more…"],["Carriage Museum","sight",-7.80548,110.36268,"","","","","","r","Houses the Sultan's horse-drawn carriages, including two beautiful carriages imported from the Netherlands and known as Golden Carriages (kereta kencana)."],["Masjid Gede Kauman","sight",-7.8039,110.3625,"","","","","","r","One of the oldest and largest mosques in Yogyakarta. Located on the west of Alun-alun Utara, this mosque was where the Sultan performs his religious rites and ceremonies."],["Sonobudoyo Museum","sight",-7.8023,110.36394,"Jl Trikora No.6","","","","","r","Many Javanese artefacts like wayang puppets, masks, statues, textiles, weapons, and a full set of gamelan instruments. Worth a visit if you have some extra time in Yogya, or you are interested in studying Javanese culture. Wayang kulit…"],["Cemeti Art House","sight",-7.8176,110.3625,"Jl DI Panjaitan No. 41","","","","","r","Fine art and modern art exhibitions, book discussions and performances."],["Gudeg Wijilan Yu Djum","restaurant",-7.80349,110.36669,"Jl. Wijilan 31, Kraton & Jalan Kaliurang km 4.5, Karangasem CT III/22","","","","","r","A more lavish variety of Gudeg, served with thicker sauce, and more expensive as well."],["Mediterranea","restaurant",-7.81845,110.36456,"Jl. Tirtodipuran No.24a Mantrijeron Yogyakarta 55143","08:00-23:00","","","","r","Serves French and Mediterranean dishes. Open all day, serving breakfast before midday. Sells espresso and has a wide range of fresh juices available. Also includes a small specialty shop with imported goods and fresh baked bread and…"],["Easy Garden","bar",-7.818,110.36133,"Jl. Suryodiningratan 10","12:00–01:30","","","","r","Cosy beanbags in a lush garden or sitting under grape pergola. Offers shisha as well for Rp75,000. Live music Th-Sa nights from 21:00. Free plunge pool, billiard table & wifi."],["Perpustakaan Iboekoe","activity",-7.81256,110.36237,"Jl. Patehan Wetan No. 3","","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"]]}